about: Custom kernels for selene.

name: Genome Auxiliary
version: R-2025-02-23
maintainer: itseunbinn
size: unknown
date: 2025-02-23
url: https://www.mediafire.com/file/rz8iibm5vrdi9ew/%255BR%255Dselene%255BAuxiliary%255D%255BGenome%255D2025-02-23.zip/file
note: Kernel Repaired, R Vendor, Linux 4.14.325, Neutron Clang 14.0.0, Initial Build. Tested on R Vendor Custom ROM A13, untested on MIUI. OC kernel, use with fan/cooler and Thermal Killer module. Credits: @Asyanx7, @fukiame (help), @YukinaSupremacy (base tree), @itseunbinn (original creator)

name: Phi Kernel
version: beta negative 1 - Lumi
maintainer: fukiame x erabye
size: unknown
date: unknown
url: https://t.me/t25_discussions/307613?single
note: Normal variant. S Vendor. MIUI 13/14 firmware only, do NOT flash on 12.5/RVendor. Works: booting (security patch newer than April 2022), fgauge, audio, video, touch (nvt/fts), wifi/bt/volte, 90/60hz, charging, camera, fingerprint, waking, ir blaster. Not working: black screen on MIUI14/HyperOS system imgs, booting on super old MIUI 13 (<13.0.4.x), charging during power on (crash). Untested: nfc. Known issue: screen off/on glitch. READ NOT WORKING LIST + KNOWN ISSUES BEFORE FLASHING

name: Phi Kernel
version: beta negative 1 - Lumi (ks12164 KSU)
maintainer: fukiame x erabye
size: unknown
date: unknown
url: https://t.me/t25_discussions/307614?single
note: KernelSU (ks12164) variant. Same notes as normal variant apply. S Vendor. MIUI 13/14 firmware only, do NOT flash on 12.5/RVendor. READ NOT WORKING LIST + KNOWN ISSUES BEFORE FLASHING

name: Niigo Kernel
version: 250730-1927 (yuki-saisei II, normal)
maintainer: fukiame
size: unknown
date: 2025-07-30
url: https://t.me/t25_discussions/386160
note: Normal (no KSU) variant. MIUI 12.5 / RVendor custom ROMs ONLY. fts and new nvt boot fine, old nvt needs testing. 300hz, PELT halflife 16ms, EXFAT fixed. No known issues so far.

